============================================================
TLS / DTLS (production crypto backend)
============================================================

This product includes software developed by the wolfSSL team.
  - Source:   https://github.com/wolfSSL/wolfssl
  - Version:  5.9.2   (pinned in src/third_party/SOURCE_VERSIONS;
                       full SHA recorded at vendoring time)
  - License:  Dual-licensed — GPLv2 (open source) **OR** commercial
              license from wolfSSL Inc.  We ship under GPLv2; commercial
              adopters must obtain a commercial license from wolfSSL
              (https://www.wolfssl.com/license/) before redistribution.
  - Location: third_party/wolfssl/

Configuration selection (see src/third_party/wolfssl/CMakeLists.txt for
the full set): DTLS=ON, TLS13=ON, ECC=ON, AES-GCM=ON, AES-CBC=ON,
SHA-256/384=ON, HKDF=ON, ChaCha20/Poly1305=ON, SRTP=ON.  RSA/DSA/PSK/OCSP/CRL
and other unused suites are disabled to keep the static library minimal.

